      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "万圣节的夜晚，这个村子里的人热情地招待着\n从冥世归来的死者。不管是人还是恶魔，全都不分彼此地迎接。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9eb75d6700dbe0767ade490acfc2fa43fab76d72f1be2984e6a4868d1d779760",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
