      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『她拥有拼凑的肉块与机械的骨骼，流淌着油的血液。\n而更令人震惊的是，她甚至能理解语言并说话』",
      "source_fingerprint": "d09c33a88b545051e76abf34c3c98b8f19d6aec06a64efe2376d74b71099388c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
