      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『这是我生涯中的最高杰作！　而且也会在我死后留存，\n成为我犯下的滔天大罪吧……因为我创造出了空洞的怪物』",
      "source_fingerprint": "90c1ad70e70929ace21f1bfda898f75432debff772c0bf3137be0624df3fa61b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/09/0029/storytimeline_090029006.json",
      "json_path": [
