      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "依我判断，你应该是负有盛名的恶魔。\n我的创造主，也一定在你居住的地狱中吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0aef924ae9c550c388bdb0a2b506069188b4af94073563434b7e441b4478c837",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
