      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "100年来，我一直等待着主人在这一夜归来。\n等待我诞生后不久，就离世的＜创造主＞。",
      "source_fingerprint": "061b85eebe656400b2092605b038187b38b3996018b5f79f70beb5cebc098de7",
